(a) surround his working compound, building, logging and landing yards, logging camps and settlements with a fire break completely cleaned of all inflammable material to a minimum width of 10 metres and maintain such a clean condition at all times;
(b) carry out protective early burning in the vicinity of the industry, camp or settlement from time to time as directed by a forest officer or manager and;

